  <metadata>
    <name>Grbaja: Škala – Katun Popadija</name>
    <desc>A moderate trail in Prokletije National Park, 5.6 km long, with a total ascent of 434 m. It leads from Škala to Katun Popadija along a gravel road, passing a drinking fountain and the historic structure Štala. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
